===============================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.9.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"; type="application/ld+json"
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)

[
  {
    "attributeName": "speed",
    "id": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/default-context/speed",
    "type": "Attribute",
    "typeNames": [
      "Vehicle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "attributeName": "color",
    "id": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/default-context/color",
    "type": "Attribute",
    "typeNames": [
      "Vehicle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "attributeName": "brand",
    "id": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/default-context/brand",
    "type": "Attribute",
    "typeNames": [
      "Vehicle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "attributeName": "temp",
    "id": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/default-context/temp",
    "type": "Attribute",
    "typeNames": [
      "Sensor"
    ]
  }
]



08. GET /attributes/speed → Attribute
======================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.9.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"; type="application/ld+json"
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)

{
  "attributeCount": 2,
  "attributeName": "speed",
  "attributeTypes": [
    "Property"
  ],
  "id": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/default-context/speed",
  "type": "Attribute",
  "typeNames": [
    "Vehicle"
  ]
}



09. GET /attributes/noSuch → 404
=================================
HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)

{
  "detail": "attribute 'noSuch' not found",
  "status": 404,
  "title": "Not Found",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/ResourceNotFound"
}



--TEARDOWN--
swBrokerStop
swDbDrop
